{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086","title":"腾讯WeMM-Video-9B能同时看画面、听原声，接入前要准备什么？","date":"2026-11-22","updated":"2026-11-22","summary":"官方已列出权重与部署方法，但视频原声需要明确接入，运行环境也有补丁要求。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/wordmark-wide-05acad5ce433.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"WeMM-Video-9B","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-9B","source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<p>把带讲解的视频交给模型，想要的往往不只是“画面里有什么”，还包括“讲解说了什么、声音和画面能不能对上”。腾讯WeMM-Video-9B的官方模型卡明确写到：它可以结合视频帧与原始音轨描述事件、转写语音，并围绕看到和听到的内容推理，最终输出文字。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/source-evidence-1-a8d3a7b9.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/1ef0df259b8d51b61438893e-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/1ef0df259b8d51b61438893e-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/source-evidence-1-a8d3a7b9.png\" alt=\"官方能力说明\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>真正影响接入选择的，是声音有没有送进去、权重之外还要准备什么，以及部署后怎样检查结果。官方已经列出权重与调用路径；准备接入时，应先确认这些环节，而不是把“支持视频”直接理解成上传文件就能完整分析。</p>\n<h2>想让它听懂视频，先确认原声有没有送进去</h2>\n<p>官方把WeMM-Video介绍为支持中文和英文的音视频联合理解模型系列。WeMM-Video-9B接受文字、图片、音频和视频，返回文字答案。它适合关注视频内容分析、语音转写和声画联合问答的人；这里的“视频能力”指理解输入内容，不是生成视频。</p>\n<p>这有点像在微信里收到一段带讲解的视频：只看截出来的画面，能知道镜头拍到了什么，却听不到讲解。官方Python示例也明确区分了输入方式：video只处理视频帧，video_audio才包含原始音轨。文件里有声音，还需要选对处理方式。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/source-evidence-2-e726d3b2.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/8da18c16f2d327113bcf5228-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/8da18c16f2d327113bcf5228-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/source-evidence-2-e726d3b2.png\" alt=\"官方输入说明\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>部署为服务后，这个区别仍然存在。官方接口示例通过video_url.use_audio控制是否带入原声，还通过fps和max_frames控制视频抽帧。抽帧可以理解为从视频中挑出画面交给模型，因此验收答案时，也要检查关键动作是否落在实际送入的画面里。</p>\n<p>官方说明，视觉和音频编码器会把媒体转换成词元，与文字一起交给语言模型处理，视频帧还带有时间戳。词元可以理解为模型处理内容时使用的小单元，类似一长段微信消息需要拆成可处理的片段；这里的音视频也会先转换，而不是把原文件不加处理地直接交给语言模型。</p>\n<h2>权重已有说明，运行条件还要分别确认</h2>\n<p>官方模型卡已列出BF16 Safetensors权重，权重文件体积为19.54 GiB，并提供FP8、AWQ、GGUF和NVFP4量化版本入口。对准备自行部署的人，这意味着已经有具体文件格式和部署资料可查，而不只是等待未来开放的预告。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/source-evidence-3-e7776d03.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/fdbd35f1fa134f71ff96d08b-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/fdbd35f1fa134f71ff96d08b-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/source-evidence-3-e7776d03.png\" alt=\"官方权重说明\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>19.54 GiB是权重文件体积，不是整套任务的显存需求。官方要求为完整权重、媒体输入和生成缓存一起预留GPU内存。就像快递柜除了放包裹，还得留出取件操作的位置：模型加载进去以后，处理视频和生成答案仍然需要额外空间，不能只按下载包大小选择设备。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/source-evidence-4-75844254.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/882d3bcfdf1e83404352d26a-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/882d3bcfdf1e83404352d26a-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/source-evidence-4-75844254.png\" alt=\"官方内存提醒\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>部署环境也有明确要求。官方要求安装匹配的WeMM运行时补丁，并给出了打补丁的vLLM和SGLang路径。打算接入已有服务时，应先检查对应依赖与补丁说明，不能把模型名称换进现有启动命令，就认定环境已经兼容。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/source-evidence-5-ab5bde76.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/656c064a6350ecb52cd50174-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/656c064a6350ecb52cd50174-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/source-evidence-5-ab5bde76.png\" alt=\"官方部署要求\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>许可证方面，模型卡标注Apache License 2.0，同时提醒第三方组件仍受各自原有条款约束。权重文件、使用许可、运行时支持和硬件容量是不同的问题：有文件可取，不代表任意设备都能运行；有模型许可，也仍需查看相关组件的要求。</p>\n<p>如果只想打开托管接口直接使用，还要留意服务入口。所提供页面在采集时显示，该模型尚未由Hugging Face的Inference Providers部署。这个状态只说明该平台的这类托管入口，不能据此判断其他渠道是否提供服务。</p>\n<h2>先验收声音与画面，再决定是否接入工作流</h2>\n<p>官方记录的部署验证包括：打补丁的vLLM在H20上加载模型，并完成文字、图片、音频及带原声视频的生成检查；直接通过Transformers加载和CPU文字生成检查也已通过。这些记录能帮助选择起步路径，但没有给出消费级设备的视频处理速度或完整硬件需求。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/source-evidence-6-2abeda71.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/4cf61e9788aa12e526351be9-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/4cf61e9788aa12e526351be9-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-f70f1895e086/source-evidence-6-2abeda71.png\" alt=\"官方验证记录\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>准备验证时，可以先沿官方快速开始说明，从项目根目录运行带原声MP4的示例，分别检查画面描述和声音概括是否对应原片。之后再按官方输入区分，观察只送画面与同时送入原声时的回答。对需要声画联合分析的任务，验收重点是答案有没有准确利用相关声音，而不只是写出一段流畅描述。</p>\n<p>官方还提供直接回答和推理回答模式。选择模式时，仍应回到同一段原片检查答案：画面事件是否说对，语音转写是否准确，声音与画面的关系有没有依据。对于接入选择，能否在目标环境中重复完成自己的任务，比回答是否写得更长更有意义。</p>\n<p>需要部署的人，可以从<a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-9B#quick-start\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-9B#quick-start\">官方模型卡与快速开始</a>进入，再查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Tencent/WeMM-Video/blob/main/docs/serving.md#runtime-profiles\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://github.com/Tencent/WeMM-Video/blob/main/docs/serving.md#runtime-profiles\">运行环境说明</a>和<a href=\"https://github.com/Tencent/WeMM-Video/blob/main/docs/serving.md#send-a-video-request\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://github.com/Tencent/WeMM-Video/blob/main/docs/serving.md#send-a-video-request\">视频请求说明</a>。量化版是否适合目标环境、实际处理速度如何，仍需结合对应版本文档和实际运行结果判断。</p>\n<p>这类工具是否值得接入，关键在于声音能否为任务补上画面之外的信息。对需要同时核对动作与讲解的工作，WeMM-Video-9B提供了明确的尝试路径。下一步值得验收的是：加入原声后，答案是否更准确地回答了原来的问题，以及这条处理链能否在目标设备上持续运行。</p>\n<h2>官方资料</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-9B\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-9B\">腾讯混元 官方发布说明</a></li>\n</ul>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5","rawId":"obsidian:2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5","slug":"2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5","legacyPaths":[],"title":"腾讯WeMM-Video能连画面带声音理解视频，部署前该看哪些条件？","date":"2026-11-22","updated":"2026-11-22","summary":"腾讯WeMM-Video能连画面带声音理解视频，部署前该看哪些条件？","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5/wordmark-wide-bae77126e5e7.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5/wordmark-wide-bae77126e5e7.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"WeMM-Video-35BA3B","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-35BA3B","sourcePath":"posts/2026-11-22-official-54156d2227e5.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-21-official-6a1fa8a670ef","rawId":"obsidian:2026-11-21-official-6a1fa8a670ef","slug":"2026-11-21-official-6a1fa8a670ef","legacyPaths":[],"title":"腾讯WeMM-Video-4B能结合画面与原声理解视频，部署前要确认什么？","date":"2026-11-21","updated":"2026-11-21","summary":"腾讯WeMM-Video-4B能结合画面与原声理解视频，部署前要确认什么？","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-新锐模型","name":"新锐模型","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-21-official-6a1fa8a670ef/wordmark-wide-303d0758c443.jpg","cover":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-21-official-6a1fa8a670ef/wordmark-wide-303d0758c443.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"model","discoveryName":"WeMM-Video-4B","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-4B","sourcePath":"posts/2026-11-21-official-6a1fa8a670ef.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-21-official-53f2c8c25c06","rawId":"obsidian:2026-11-21-official-53f2c8c25c06","slug":"2026-11-21-official-53f2c8c25c06","legacyPaths":[],"title":"WeMM-Video-2B-NVFP4 能在本地看懂有声视频吗？","date":"2026-11-21","updated":"2026-11-21","summary":"官方已列出权重与有声视频验证记录，但4.90 GiB不是显存门槛，部署还要匹配运行环境。","categories":[{